From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thuong Vo <66083331+SekiroKenjii@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 03:37:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build: compile the Apex Code plugin into gnome-builder

Apex Code is GNOME Builder with an Apex series (ADR 0017 in apex-linux/apex).
Its sources come from Source1, a git archive of desktop/gnome-builder/ in
apex-gnome, which %prep unpacks at the top of this tree as src/plugins/apex/.
src/plugins/meson.build reads it after podman, which it depends on: the
plugin adds its sources to plugins_sources and its apex-builder gettext
domain.
---
 src/plugins/meson.build | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/plugins/meson.build b/src/plugins/meson.build
index 2d9fc82..b9563de 100644
--- a/src/plugins/meson.build
+++ b/src/plugins/meson.build
@@ -116,6 +116,7 @@ subdir('open-with-external')
 subdir('platformui')
 subdir('phpize')
 subdir('podman')
+subdir('apex')
 subdir('project-tree')
 subdir('projectui')
 subdir('pygi')
